quest":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106622"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2115871938/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":285,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2115777994,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":5,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123624461","pull_request_review_id":2892059451,"id":2123624461,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5-k_AN","diff_hunk":"@@ -76,29 +76,15 @@ bool AimModifier3D::_get(const StringName &p_path, Variant &r_ret) const {\n \treturn true;\n }\n \n-void AimModifier3D::_validate_dynamic_prop(PropertyInfo &p_property) const {\n-\tPackedStringArray split = p_property.name.split(\"/\");\n-\tif (split.size() == 3 && split[0] == \"settings\" && (split[2] == \"primary_rotation_axis\" || split[2] == \"use_secondary_rotation\")) {\n-\t\tint which = split[1].to_int();\n-\t\tif (!is_using_euler(which)) {\n-\t\t\tp_property.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE;\n-\t\t}\n-\t}\n-}\n-\n void AimModifier3D::_get_property_list(List<PropertyInfo> *p_list) const {\n-\tBoneConstraint3D::get_property_list(p_list);\n-\tLocalVector<PropertyInfo> props;\n \tfor (int i = 0; i < settings.size(); i++) {","path":"scene/3d/aim_modifier_3d.cpp","commit_id":"713ed59a7769e9af19f0191a81ea02e678c244fc","original_commit_id":"af09f02d310e8d636cea61919c096c4cfc8d154e","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This cannot be deleted. As noted in the comment in BoneConstraint3D, this is necessary to prevent the inspector from being split and to combine it with the parent class inspector.\r\n\r\n**bone_constraint_3d.cpp**\r\n```cpp\r\nprotected:\r\n\tVector<BoneConstraint3DSetting *> settings;\r\n\r\n\tbool _get(const StringName &p_path, Variant &r_ret) const;\r\n\tbool _set(const StringName &p_path, const Variant &p_value);\r\n\r\n\t// Define get_property_list() instead of _get_property_list()\r\n\t// to merge child class properties into parent class array inspector.\r\n\tvoid get_property_list(List<PropertyInfo> *p_list) const; // Will be called by child classes.\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso I commented in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100984#discussion_r2123634331.\r\n\r\n> It is possible to perform validation within child classes, but in order to avoid array splitting, the properties of these child classes must be added to the property list of the parent class.\r\n\r\n> In other words, this approach is necessary because it extends the parent class struct. If you want to remove it completely, you should remove the parent class itself and duplicate the struct `BoneConstraint3DSetting` into each child classes without extending.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2865facd-5603-429c-81e6-f7d27bf8e448)\r\n\r\nAfter this PR:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e48fddae-6866-4999-8d9f-5b9b867dce71)\r\n\r\nIf we delete this line, and add the amount/apply_bone/reference_bone properties to the parent class (although it is completely lacking in this PR), the array will be displayed twice in the inspector and become corrupted, so we need to add the parent class array element properties to the child class.","created_at":"2025-06-03T12:09:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T12:36:18Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106622#discussion_r2123624461","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106622","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123624461"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106622#discussion_r2123624461"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106622"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123624461/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":83,"original_line":83,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":17,"position":26,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123679087","pull_request_review_id":2892146108,"id":2123679087,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5-lMVv","diff_hunk":"@@ -76,29 +76,15 @@ bool AimModifier3D::_get(const StringName &p_path, Variant &r_ret) const {\n \treturn true;\n }\n \n-void AimModifier3D::_validate_dynamic_prop(PropertyInfo &p_property) const {\n-\tPackedStringArray split = p_property.name.split(\"/\");\n-\tif (split.size() == 3 && split[0] == \"settings\" && (split[2] == \"primary_rotation_axis\" || split[2] == \"use_secondary_rotation\")) {\n-\t\tint which = split[1].to_int();\n-\t\tif (!is_using_euler(which)) {\n-\t\t\tp_property.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE;\n-\t\t}\n-\t}\n-}\n-\n void AimModifier3D::_get_property_list(List<PropertyInfo> *p_list) const {\n-\tBoneConstraint3D::get_property_list(p_list);\n-\tLocalVector<PropertyInfo> props;\n \tfor (int i = 0; i < settings.size(); i++) {","path":"scene/3d/aim_modifier_3d.cpp","commit_id":"713ed59a7769e9af19f0191a81ea02e678c244fc","original_commit_id":"af09f02d310e8d636cea61919c096c4cfc8d154e","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Oh, I see. Hiding the get_property_list  method of BoneConstraint3D seems a bit of a hack, it also makes the returned property list incomplete. I wonder if there's a better way.","created_at":"2025-06-03T12:34:45Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T12:34:45Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106622#discussion_r2123679087","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106622","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123679087"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106622#discussion_r2123679087"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106622"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123679087/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":83,"original_line":83,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2123624461,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":17,"position":26,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2123684453","pull_request_review_id":2892155904,"id":2123684453,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5-lNpl","diff_hunk":"@@ -76,29 +76,15 @@ bool AimModifier3D::_get(const StringName &p_path, Variant &r_ret) const {\n \treturn true;\n }\n \n-void AimModifier3D::_validate_dynamic_prop(PropertyInfo &p_property) const {\n-\tPackedStringArray split = p_property.name.split(\"/\");\n-\tif (split.size() == 3 && split[0] == \"settings\" && (split[2] == \"primary_rotation_axis\" || split[2] == \"use_secondary_rotation\")) {\n-\t\tint which = split[1].to_int();\n-\t\tif (!is_using_euler(which)) {\n-\t\t\tp_property.usage = PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE;\n-\t\t}\n-\t}\n-}\n-\n void AimModifier3D::_get_property_list(List<PropertyInfo> *p_list) const {\n-\tBoneConstraint3D::get_property_list(p_list);\n-\tLocalVector<PropertyInfo> props;\n \tfor (int i = 0; i < settings.size(); i++) {","path":"scene/3d/aim_modifier_3d.cpp","commit_id":"713ed59a7769e9af19f0191a81ea02e678c244fc","original_commit_id":"af09f02d310e8d636cea61919c096c4cfc8d154e","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}